WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Ai, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Honto no otoko o shitteiru kai?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
Horeteru onna ni yowai sa

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Aitsu wa ore yori yasashikute

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Aitsu wa ore yori tsuyoino kai

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
Tsuki yo ga tsumetaku

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
Kokoro terasu

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
Omoi ga kage e to utsusarete

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Ai, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
<i>Al onna jounetsu omae ga kureta mono</i>

00:01:29.256 --> 00:01:35.195
sleep In our
flower Garden, Beast

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.210
What's wrong, Cleao?

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:52.279
You've been sighing the whole time.

00:01:52.279 --> 00:01:54.414
It's so boring.

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:58.986
It's been a week since we began our journey,
but nothing's happened.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:01.622
Say, Orphen, why don't we get
in the hiking mood

00:02:01.622 --> 00:02:03.790
and climb some mountains
every once in a while?

00:02:06.193 --> 00:02:08.128
The Mountains of Kahlna?

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:13.900
Nope. That place is kind of a pain,
so we'll take the low road.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.902
Really! It's so boring!

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:19.673
You can't dress up on a journey,
and you don't eat tasty things.

00:02:19.673 --> 00:02:22.275
If I had known it would be like this,
| wouldn't have come along.

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:23.744
Then go home!

00:02:23.744 --> 00:02:26.780
| don't remember ever asking you
to come with us.

00:02:26.780 --> 00:02:28.582
What?! Cheapskate!

00:02:28.582 --> 00:02:29.650
You know...

00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:32.252
Oh, that's right! I just remembered
something good!

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:33.787
What? What?

00:02:34.421 --> 00:02:36.990
If I remember correctly,
there's a solar eclipse tomorrow.

00:02:38.058 --> 00:02:40.694
You can see an eclipse anywhere!

00:02:40.694 --> 00:02:43.163
That's not entirely correct, you know.
Tomorrow's special.

00:02:43.764 --> 00:02:46.166
No matter what you say,
it's an annular eclipse.

00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:49.803
An annular eclipse? I can't wait!

00:02:49.803 --> 00:02:51.838
It's something you don't get to see often.

00:02:52.139 --> 00:02:53.573
That's so true!

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.142
You've never seen one before, Majic?

00:02:55.142 --> 00:02:56.309
No, I've never seen one before.

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:57.044
That so?

00:02:57.044 --> 00:02:59.346
Really! What's with the two of you
getting so excited?

00:02:59.346 --> 00:02:59.946
Then you must be excited, right? Really!
What's with the two of you getting so excited?

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:00.747
Then you must be excited, right?
Are you planning on leaving me behind?!

00:03:00.747 --> 00:03:01.448
Master, of course you've seen-
Are you planning on leaving me behind?!

00:03:01.448 --> 00:03:02.683
Master, of course you've seen-

00:03:10.724 --> 00:03:11.625
Jeez...

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:34.881
Why do I have to do stuff like this?

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:38.018
She must be happy.

00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:39.219
That's it!

00:03:44.291 --> 00:03:45.292
Huh?

00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:47.294
Where's Majic?

00:03:47.294 --> 00:03:49.496
Intense Light that I do create.

00:03:57.404 --> 00:03:58.939
Master!

00:03:59.206 --> 00:04:01.408
Refracting light?

00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:04.177
I... Nothing like that!
Really, I had no intention-

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:09.483
An original incantation? That's pretty good.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:11.985
No, well, it wasn't all that-

00:04:12.753 --> 00:04:14.321
| wasn't praising you!

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:16.022
You saw, didn't you?

00:04:17.124 --> 00:04:19.826
You two are so...

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.895
Sorry, Cleao!

00:04:21.895 --> 00:04:23.330
Unforgivable!

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.969
Hey!

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:30.303
Majic, apologize!

00:04:30.303 --> 00:04:31.104
That's why I said, "Sorry!"
Majic, apologize!

00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:31.705
That's why I said, "Sorry!"

00:04:31.705 --> 00:04:32.906
That's why I said, "Sorry!"
You said "sorry", but...

00:04:32.906 --> 00:04:33.473
You said "sorry", but...

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.408
That Maijic...

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:39.412
It's supposed to take five years
to be able to use magic normally.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.414
This is no joke!

00:04:42.048 --> 00:04:46.219
At this rate, I won't be able to
charge tuition starting next year!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.121
Really!

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.923
Save me!

00:04:59.366 --> 00:05:01.902
Orphen, did you make this?

00:05:03.103 --> 00:05:04.237
Yeah, well...

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:08.308
But Master, weren't you looking
for a can opener earlier?

00:05:09.209 --> 00:05:10.677
| can't believe it!

00:05:10.677 --> 00:05:13.413
How do you cook canned food
to make it taste like this?!

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:16.550
You're so noisy! Then don't eat it,
and hurry on to sleep!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:18.151
We're up early tomorrow too, you know?

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:23.723
Jeez, complaining about dinner
when we have to hurry.

00:05:24.591 --> 00:05:27.260
Say, Orphen, if we have to hurry so much,

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.729
don't you think it'd be faster
going over the mountain?

00:05:29.729 --> 00:05:33.266
| don't think so, and I said we weren't
going over the mountain.

00:05:33.266 --> 00:05:34.634
Cheap! Cheap! Cheapskate!

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:37.604
Would it hurt you to let us climb a mountain?!

00:05:38.405 --> 00:05:40.841
Come to think of it, you did say
something this afternoon.

00:05:40.841 --> 00:05:43.577
Something about Mount Kahlna
being a pain, or something?

00:05:43.577 --> 00:05:45.946
It's the legendary mountain of evil.

00:05:45.946 --> 00:05:50.383
And to top it off, they say fearsome beasts
have lived there since the beginning of time,

00:05:50.383 --> 00:05:52.419
no one has ever come close to them.

00:05:53.086 --> 00:05:56.556
Could it be, Master, that you're scared?

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:58.558
Don't say dumb things!

00:05:58.558 --> 00:06:02.262
Me? I'd defeat the beasts,
and receive the Golden Blessing.

00:06:02.262 --> 00:06:04.598
Defeat the beasts,
and receive the Golden Blessing?

00:06:04.598 --> 00:06:08.068
Golden Blessing?
What's that?! What's that?!

00:06:08.068 --> 00:06:10.403
| don't' know why, but that sounds really fun!

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:13.306
Let's go! It's decided then!

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:15.909
Tomorrow's the start of an adventure together!

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:18.645
That's why I'm saying we're not going.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:22.983
What? What? Are you really scared then?

00:06:22.983 --> 00:06:24.551
Orphen the Cowardly!

00:06:24.551 --> 00:06:26.152
It's a pain!

00:06:26.152 --> 00:06:28.822
If you want to go so badly, then go yourself!

00:06:30.724 --> 00:06:31.892
Oh, no.

00:06:39.099 --> 00:06:41.334
That!

00:06:43.303 --> 00:06:47.307
"Please don't look for us. Cleao."

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:52.545
Jeez...

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.548
They're hopeless.

00:06:58.118 --> 00:07:00.520
My stomach's so empty!

00:07:00.820 --> 00:07:03.189
Let's turn back after all, Big Brother!

00:07:03.189 --> 00:07:05.091
My hands already hurt!

00:07:05.358 --> 00:07:07.694
What are you saying after we've
come all this way, Dortin?!

00:07:07.694 --> 00:07:09.029
Remember the legend!

00:07:09.029 --> 00:07:11.765
Have you forgotten our supreme mission?

00:07:11.765 --> 00:07:14.901
That thing?! You decided that
all by yourself, Big Brother!

00:07:14.901 --> 00:07:16.736
Get them before they get you!

00:07:16.736 --> 00:07:18.738
If I don't get them, then who will?

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:22.475
My glorious self is going to be
receiving the Golden Blessing!

00:07:29.049 --> 00:07:33.586
Why do I have to be dragged along
on your adventure, Cleao?

00:07:33.586 --> 00:07:35.422
It's your punishment for yesterday.

00:07:35.922 --> 00:07:38.258
Somehow this seems more than
what my crime was worth.

00:07:38.258 --> 00:07:39.526
Did you say something?

00:07:39.526 --> 00:07:40.527
Nothing really!

00:07:40.527 --> 00:07:43.463
If you keep muttering, Orphen will catch up!

00:07:44.531 --> 00:07:45.799
| understand already.

00:07:51.638 --> 00:07:52.872
What?

00:07:52.872 --> 00:07:54.107
No clue.

00:07:56.509 --> 00:07:58.545
Let's give up already, Big Brother!

00:07:58.545 --> 00:08:01.915
You idiot, we can't just give up
on the Golden Blessing!

00:08:02.349 --> 00:08:03.483
You two!

00:08:05.318 --> 00:08:06.853
Why are you here?

00:08:06.853 --> 00:08:07.988
Us?

00:08:07.988 --> 00:08:10.690
We set off on a journey with Orphen, right?

00:08:12.592 --> 00:08:15.295
Then, that second-rate sorcerer is here too?

00:08:15.295 --> 00:08:17.263
Right now we're going separate ways.

00:08:17.263 --> 00:08:20.433
More importantly, that Golden Blessing,
you were talking about,

00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:22.335
tell us about it in more detail.

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:24.904
Like I'd tell you about that!

00:08:26.139 --> 00:08:27.874
The Sword of Baltanders!

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.411
Give that back, thief!

00:08:31.411 --> 00:08:33.513
That's a keepsake from my father!

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:37.283
This is now-

00:08:40.987 --> 00:08:43.056
...mine...

00:08:50.597 --> 00:08:52.232
Isn't that nice, Cleao?

00:08:52.232 --> 00:08:54.467
Now you can finally go home.

00:08:59.739 --> 00:09:00.640
What?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:05.412
It's my very important sword,
but I'll leave it in your care.

00:09:05.412 --> 00:09:07.547
You'll take good care of it, won't you?

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:11.751
If I have to. Since you beg so much,
then I could take care-

00:09:13.053 --> 00:09:15.021
I shall humbly care for it.

00:09:15.021 --> 00:09:17.924
| won't allow you to exchange it for money!

00:09:17.924 --> 00:09:19.759
Of course not, Ma'am.

00:09:19.759 --> 00:09:21.861
Then, it's decided!

00:09:26.833 --> 00:09:29.602
This has to be where the beasts live.

00:09:30.136 --> 00:09:31.271
Here I go!

00:09:35.842 --> 00:09:38.812
That we are here now, together,

00:09:38.812 --> 00:09:41.414
is because of the strength of
my natural benevolence!

00:09:41.414 --> 00:09:43.583
Let's combine our strengths
and defeat the beasts,

00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:47.620
and together we shall receive
that Golden Blessing or whatever.

00:09:48.121 --> 00:09:50.523
That's a pretty weird thing
for you to say, Big Brother.

00:09:51.825 --> 00:09:55.395
Stupid, as soon as we get the Blessing,
we're going to break away from them.

00:09:56.262 --> 00:09:58.264
| thought it'd be something like that after all.

00:09:58.264 --> 00:10:00.333
Hey, we've come pretty far.

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:02.869
When are the beasts
supposed to appear anyway?

00:10:02.869 --> 00:10:06.139
Well now, they're probably afraid of us, right?

00:10:10.443 --> 00:10:13.546
What they say and what they do just don't mesh.

00:10:15.014 --> 00:10:16.449
Those beasts!

00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:21.754
You're ten years too early to dare challenge me,
Volcan Polkano of Mazmaturia!

00:10:21.754 --> 00:10:23.623
They were just regular bats.

00:10:23.623 --> 00:10:25.492
They... they just surprised me, is all.

00:10:25.725 --> 00:10:29.229
You bats! I'll kill every one of you later!

00:10:29.229 --> 00:10:31.531
Hey, isn't that?

00:10:32.532 --> 00:10:33.800
It's the exit.

00:10:40.473 --> 00:10:41.508
It's a castle!

00:10:41.508 --> 00:10:43.243
Do you think someone lives in it?

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:46.446
No way, it seems pretty old.

00:10:46.446 --> 00:10:50.183
But this flower garden looks as if
someone's been caring for it.

00:10:50.183 --> 00:10:54.254
| see; I get it! The treasure is in that castle!

00:10:54.254 --> 00:10:55.922
How do you know?

00:10:57.657 --> 00:11:01.194
Has there ever been a time when
my glorious intuition has been wrong?

00:11:01.194 --> 00:11:02.962
It's always wrong.

00:11:03.296 --> 00:11:04.931
Anyway, let's go and see.

00:11:15.208 --> 00:11:17.110
Majic, what are you doing?

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:18.311
Sorry!

00:11:24.117 --> 00:11:25.118
Majic!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.151
Wait!

00:11:59.252 --> 00:12:00.420
Everyone get back!

00:12:05.325 --> 00:12:06.726
Majic, watch out!

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.830
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:12:15.501 --> 00:12:16.502
| did it!

00:12:21.474 --> 00:12:24.077
Sir Majic, are you able to use sorcery?

00:12:24.077 --> 00:12:25.311
Well, a little.

00:12:25.311 --> 00:12:27.146
You're only an apprentice.

00:12:28.848 --> 00:12:31.251
Now do you appreciate my stupendous power?!

00:12:31.784 --> 00:12:33.853
You didn't do it, Big Brother.

00:12:33.853 --> 00:12:37.056
Okay, all that's left is to enter the castle
and search for treasure!

00:12:45.431 --> 00:12:46.499
It's still alive!

00:12:46.499 --> 00:12:47.500
That can't be!

00:12:49.068 --> 00:12:52.305
It seems much angrier than it was.

00:12:52.305 --> 00:12:56.743
You lousy sorcerer! It's because you
used some half-baked magic!

00:12:56.743 --> 00:12:58.111
Do something!

00:12:59.445 --> 00:13:02.048
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:13:07.153 --> 00:13:09.922
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:13:14.861 --> 00:13:16.062
Close.

00:13:16.062 --> 00:13:17.430
What did you say?

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:18.931
It's no use! Run!

00:13:37.317 --> 00:13:39.085
It looks like it's okay now.

00:13:39.752 --> 00:13:42.188
| wonder why it didn't chase us inside?

00:13:43.089 --> 00:13:47.527
Say, I didn't notice earlier,
but there's a road over there.

00:13:48.494 --> 00:13:49.796
You're right.

00:13:53.266 --> 00:13:56.135
| wonder what that manikin is?

00:14:06.612 --> 00:14:07.814
| thought so.

00:14:19.492 --> 00:14:21.894
Are you the legendary monster, then?

00:14:26.532 --> 00:14:27.533
Don't worry.

00:14:35.308 --> 00:14:36.743
You've worked hard.

00:14:37.243 --> 00:14:38.711
Pleasant dreams.

00:14:43.683 --> 00:14:46.552
Big brother, there isn't any treasure anywhere.

00:14:47.453 --> 00:14:50.490
Damn, where in the world is it hidden?

00:14:56.963 --> 00:14:59.198
How long do we have to stay here?

00:14:59.665 --> 00:15:02.001
And what is Orphen doing anyway?

00:15:02.001 --> 00:15:05.772
But Cleao, you were the one who left
a note saying, "Please don't look for us."

00:15:05.772 --> 00:15:09.208
So? And he's really not coming?
Don't you think that's messed up?

00:15:09.776 --> 00:15:11.711
You're so confusing.

00:15:11.711 --> 00:15:14.380
Hey!

00:15:14.914 --> 00:15:17.016
How about it? What's the enemy doing?

00:15:17.016 --> 00:15:19.919
Caring for the flowers, as usual.

00:15:20.286 --> 00:15:21.487
Maybe...

00:15:21.754 --> 00:15:24.857
What if it's protecting the flower garden?

00:15:24.857 --> 00:15:29.162
Then, if we don't enter the garden,
it won't attack.

00:15:29.162 --> 00:15:31.364
If we take that road...

00:15:31.364 --> 00:15:33.800
Yes, we might be able to get away!

00:15:41.674 --> 00:15:43.176
Okay, let's go!

00:15:49.348 --> 00:15:51.417
It's just as I thought. It's not attacking.

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:52.452
I'm so glad.

00:15:57.056 --> 00:16:00.026
You old jalopy, I'll defeat you now!

00:16:04.931 --> 00:16:06.599
You! You!

00:16:06.599 --> 00:16:08.935
That's awfully petty, Big Brother.

00:16:16.843 --> 00:16:19.178
Oh dear, let's leave well enough alone.

00:16:26.586 --> 00:16:28.221
Wait a minute! What's this about?

00:16:28.221 --> 00:16:30.723
| don't understand, but let's get away!

00:16:38.965 --> 00:16:40.833
Sword of Light whom I do-

00:16:40.833 --> 00:16:41.701
...release!

00:16:48.774 --> 00:16:49.809
Orphen!

00:16:50.443 --> 00:16:53.880
Master, you came, didn't you?

00:16:56.215 --> 00:16:59.118
It's still moving! Hurry up and kill it!

00:16:59.118 --> 00:17:00.686
There's no need for that.

00:17:08.361 --> 00:17:09.362
That's...

00:17:29.682 --> 00:17:31.984
It was really a kind manikin, wasn't it?

00:17:37.623 --> 00:17:39.025
That manikin!

00:17:39.025 --> 00:17:42.194
I'll break up this dam,
and show it something worth seeing!

00:17:42.495 --> 00:17:44.297
It's no good, Big Brother.

00:17:44.297 --> 00:17:48.167
If you do that, the flower garden will be flooded!

00:17:48.167 --> 00:17:49.769
Remember the legend.

00:17:49.769 --> 00:17:52.572
The monster is definitely that thing.

00:17:52.572 --> 00:17:56.108
So if we defeat it, then the treasure will be ours!

00:17:56.108 --> 00:17:57.510
Don't!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.644
Here I go, Dortin!

00:18:20.333 --> 00:18:21.167
Volcan!

00:18:21.167 --> 00:18:22.201
Dortin!

00:18:22.201 --> 00:18:23.336
Those two!

00:18:26.806 --> 00:18:29.275
Silence of the Angels that I shatter!

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:50.129
Three hundred years ago?

00:18:50.129 --> 00:18:54.734
Yes, they say this flower garden
was created by the castle's owner,

00:18:54.734 --> 00:18:56.569
a being from Heaven.

00:18:56.569 --> 00:19:02.008
And that he ordered the mechanical
manikins to protect the garden.

00:19:02.008 --> 00:19:05.011
A being from Heaven? Who, or what, was that?

00:19:05.011 --> 00:19:08.681
What we call, in general, the ancient sorcerers.

00:19:08.681 --> 00:19:12.051
They were able to use
unbelievably powerful magics.

00:19:12.618 --> 00:19:16.255
Then, that the manikin is working even now, is...

00:19:16.255 --> 00:19:19.425
Well, it seems even they are
starting to show wear and tear.

00:19:19.425 --> 00:19:23.829
What about the Golden Blessing?
It was just a rumor.

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:25.364
How boring.

00:19:25.364 --> 00:19:27.733
No, it's not entirely a rumor.

00:19:29.669 --> 00:19:31.303
It should begin soon.

00:19:35.741 --> 00:19:37.743
The annular eclipse is about to begin!

00:19:57.296 --> 00:19:59.665
That's the Golden Blessing?

00:20:27.026 --> 00:20:28.728
Wow!

00:20:30.262 --> 00:20:31.964
Beautiful!

00:20:36.335 --> 00:20:41.173
...and those flowers bloom
only during the annular solar eclipse.

00:20:41.741 --> 00:20:43.776
I'll see it someday.

00:20:45.044 --> 00:20:48.047
What? You want to go together, Krylancelo?

00:20:49.115 --> 00:20:50.783
Okay, definitely then.

00:20:51.817 --> 00:20:53.085
It's a promise.

00:20:55.054 --> 00:20:56.455
A promise?

00:21:14.673 --> 00:21:17.576
How long do you think they'll go on protecting it?

00:21:17.576 --> 00:21:20.279
The flower garden that no one's left to see?

00:21:20.279 --> 00:21:24.950
To a mechanical manikin their master's orders
are absolute, their everything.

00:21:25.584 --> 00:21:28.988
So, eternally, until they can no longer move.

00:21:29.288 --> 00:21:33.425
Eternally, by themselves. Aren't they lonely?

00:21:33.425 --> 00:21:36.262
If they have those kinds of feelings, I guess so.

00:21:36.595 --> 00:21:37.997
That's right!

00:21:37.997 --> 00:21:40.733
So then, why don't you stay here?

00:21:40.733 --> 00:21:43.135
You did say you were tired of journeying, right?

00:21:44.003 --> 00:21:46.138
Th-that's not true.

00:21:46.138 --> 00:21:48.040
I've decided to come along with you.

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:50.009
Hey, what?

00:21:50.009 --> 00:21:53.746
After all, I don't think I'll be bored
if I'm with you, Orphen.

00:21:57.483 --> 00:22:00.920
Master, please don't leave me behind!

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:17.136
Majic meets a mysterious
young girl in the forest,

00:22:17.136 --> 00:22:19.371
and gets abducted by her relatives.

00:22:19.705 --> 00:22:22.541
Batrov? I've heard the name.

00:22:23.409 --> 00:22:26.478
This village, it couldn't be the
hidden village of the Dragon Faith?

00:22:26.478 --> 00:22:27.713
This is bad.

00:22:27.713 --> 00:22:30.783
It will come endowed with the world's
ultimate battle capability.

00:22:30.783 --> 00:22:32.251
The Deep Dragon!

00:22:32.251 --> 00:22:34.253
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.253 --> 00:22:36.188
the priestess EMBRACED BY A ORAGON
